  "description": "NAPGOE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H110 Cl4 Dy6 N16 O22 2+,C1 H4 O1,2(C2 H3 N1),3.5(H2 O1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.726-3.956 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.22-114.06°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C100H185Cl6Dy6N20O41.",
